 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Closedness of the intermediate overlap",
 "statement": "The canonical immersion\n\n$$\nU_i\\longrightarrow\nU\\times_S(X_i\\setminus\\overline Z_{i,j})\n$$\n\nis a closed immersion.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-two-open/lemma-nagata-intermediate-overlap-closed.md",
